{%- if request.locale.iso_code contains 'fr' -%}
<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="designer" data-modules="1,2,3,4,5,6"><header class="r-intro r-intro--small"><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI</p><h1>Devenir designer partenaire</h1><p>Proposez vos idées originales à SUIJI.</p></header><section class="r-split"><figure><img src="{{ 'suiji-geometric-drop-earrings-editorial.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Étude conceptuelle SUIJI" width="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=""></figure><div><h2>Votre regard. Une structure commune.</h2><p>Présentez vos œuvres originales et votre démarche. Les droits, la faisabilité, la version publique et les conditions commerciales font l’objet d’accords distincts. Une candidature n’active ni taux de redevance ni accord de vente.</p><a class="r-link" href="/pages/creator-partnerships">Partenariats de contenu<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></div></section><section class="r-section"><h2>Présentez votre travail</h2><form class="r-form r-form--wide" data-email-draft><label>Nom public<input name="name" required></label><label>E-mail<input type="email" name="email" required></label><label>Lien du portfolio<input name="portfolio" type="url" required></label><label>Démarche, idée et sources de référence<textarea name="question" rows="6" required></textarea></label><label>Usage de l’IA, le cas échéant<input name="ai_use"></label><button class="r-button" type="submit">Préparer ma présentation</button><div data-email-result role="status"></div></form></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Un choix distinct à chaque étape</h2></div><p>Avant une candidature publique, choisissez la version exacte et le nom de crédit, puis confirmez les droits. La vente nécessite un accord distinct ; les brouillons privés ne sont pas publiés automatiquement.</p><p>Vérification des droits → Étude technique → Candidature publique → Votes valides et sélection → Contrat et prototype → Mise en vente validée</p><p>Le calcul des redevances est défini par contrat pour la création exacte et ses ventes réelles. Aucune base, chaîne ou création tierce n’est incluse automatiquement.</p></section></div>
{%- else -%}
<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="designer" data-modules="1,2,3,4,5,6"><header class="r-intro r-intro--small"><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI</p><h1>Become a collaborating designer</h1><p>Bring your original ideas to SUIJI.</p></header><section class="r-split"><figure><img src="{{ 'suiji-geometric-drop-earrings-editorial.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SUIJI concept study" width="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=""></figure><div><h2>Your own point of view. A shared structure.</h2><p>Share original work and the way you approach a design. Rights, feasibility, the exact public version and commercial terms are reviewed separately. No royalty rate or sales arrangement is activated by an application.</p><a class="r-link" href="/en/pages/creator-partnerships">Creator content partnerships<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></div></section><section class="r-section"><h2>Introduce your work</h2><form class="r-form r-form--wide" data-email-draft><label>Display name<input name="name" required></label><label>Contact email<input type="email" name="email" required></label><label>Portfolio URL<input name="portfolio" type="url" required></label><label>Approach, idea and reference sources<textarea name="question" rows="6" required></textarea></label><label>AI use, if any<input name="ai_use"></label><button class="r-button" type="submit">Prepare my introduction</button><div data-email-result role="status"></div></form></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>A separate choice at every stage</h2></div><p>Before submitting a public candidate, choose the exact version and credit name and confirm the relevant rights. Commercial sale requires a separate agreement; private drafts are not published automatically.</p><p>Rights review → Making review → Public candidate → Valid votes and selection → Agreement and prototype → Approved listing</p><p>Any royalty calculation is defined in a contract for the exact design and its actual sales. No base, chain or another designer’s piece is included automatically.</p></section></div>
{%- endif -%}
